{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23463","headline":"与微之唱和来去常以竹筒贮诗陈协律美而成篇因以此荅 · 白居易","name":"与微之唱和来去常以竹筒贮诗陈协律美而成篇因以此荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拣得琅玕截作筒，缄题章句写心胷。\n随风每喜飞如鸟，渡水常忧化作龙。\n粉节坚如太守信，霜筠冷称大夫容。\n烦君赞咏心知愧，鱼目骊珠同一封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}